">watashi o mamoru kono namae o</span></p><p begin="14.400" end="21.040" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">優</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.400" end="14.740">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.740" end="15.580">さ</span></span></span><span begin="15.580" end="16.180">し</span><span begin="16.180" end="16.500">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.500" end="17.080">よ</span></span></span><span begin="17.080" end="17.440">ん</span><span begin="17.440" end="17.980">だ</span><span begin="18.320" end="18.920">そ</span><span begin="18.920" end="19.240">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.240" end="19.840">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.840" end="20.160">え</span></span></span><span begin="20.160" end="21.040">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">守护着我的这个名字</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yasashiku yonda sono koe ga</span></p><p begin="21.560" end="28.260" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">独</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.560" end="21.940">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.940" end="22.820">と</span></span></span><span begin="22.820" end="23.360">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.360" end="23.633">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.633" end="23.880">び</span></span></span><span begin="23.880" end="24.180">し</span><span begin="24.180" end="24.540">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">目</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="25.160" end="25.520">め</span></span></span><span begin="25.520" end="26.100">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">閉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.100" end="26.480">と</span></span></span><span begin="26.480" end="27.000">じ</span><span begin="27.000" end="27.320">ぬ</span><span begin="27.320" end="27.790">よ</span><span begin="27.790" end="28.260">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为使你不必独自寂寞入睡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hitori sabishiku me o tojinu yō</span></p><p begin="28.720" end="35.320" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.720" end="29.060">あ</span><span begin="29.060" end="29.700">な</span><span begin="29.700" end="30.040">た</span><span begin="30.040" end="31.800">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.300" end="32.580">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="32.580" end="33.170">つ</span></span></span><span begin="33.170" end="33.500">ん</span><span begin="33.500" end="35.320">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也将你环绕包裹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata o tsutsunde</span></p><p begin="35.960" end="42.140" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">柔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.960" end="36.283">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.283" end="37.100">わ</span></span></span><span begin="37.100" end="37.740">ら</span><span begin="37.740" end="38.080">か</span><span begin="38.080" end="38.350">な</span> <span begin="38.900" end="39.500">そ</span><span begin="39.500" end="39.840">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.840" end="42.140">て</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你那柔软的双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yawarakana sono te</span></p><p begin="43.040" end="48.820" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.040" end="43.400">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.400" e