in="1:49.400" end="1:49.720">ず</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.720" end="1:50.460">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽然微微涟漪藏匿起来的伤口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nurui sazanami ga kakumau kizu wa</span></p><p begin="1:51.100" end="1:57.500" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">懐</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.100" end="1:51.440">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.440" end="1:52.340">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.340" end="1:52.833">か</span><span begin="1:52.833" end="1:53.213">し</span><span begin="1:53.213" end="1:53.480">む</span><span begin="1:53.480" end="1:53.780">た</span><span begin="1:53.780" end="1:54.160">び</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:54.680" end="1:55.020">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:55.020" end="1:55.640">た</span></span></span><span begin="1:55.640" end="1:55.933">む</span><span begin="1:55.933" end="1:56.560">け</span><span begin="1:56.560" end="1:56.840">れ</span><span begin="1:56.840" end="1:57.500">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">会在每一次怀念过去时隐隐作痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">natsukashimu tabi itamu keredo</span></p><p begin="1:58.280" end="2:04.940" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.280" end="1:58.640">ひ</span><span begin="1:58.640" end="1:59.260">ず</span><span begin="1:59.260" end="1:59.610">み</span><span begin="1:59.610" end="2:01.160">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">包</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.840" end="2:02.160">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.160" end="2:02.780">つ</span></span></span><span begin="2:02.780" end="2:03.120">ん</span><span begin="2:03.120" end="2:04.940">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">然而未来的阴霾却已被温柔包裹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hizumi o tsutsunde</span></p><p begin="2:05.380" end="2:12.040" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">導</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.380" end="2:05.700">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.700" end="2:06.660">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.660" end="2:07.160">び</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.160" end="2:07.580">き</span><span begin="2:07.580" end="2:08.440">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.440" end="2:09.040">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.040" end="2:09.340">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.340" end="2:12.040">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">愿在指引之下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">michibiki no naka de</span></p><p begin="2:12.620" end="2:18.380" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.620" end="2:12.980">は</span><span begin="2:12.980" end="2:13.800">ぐ</span><span begin="2:13.800" end="2:14.400">れ</span><span begin="2:14.400" end="2:14.700">ぬ</span><span begin="2:14.700" end="2:15.110">よ</span><span begin="2:15.110" end="2:15.520">う</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">進</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.860" end="2:16.180">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.180" end="2:16.480">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.520" end="2:17.020">も</span><span begin="2:17.020" end="2:18.380">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们再也不会走散 坚定地前进吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hagurenu yō susumō</span></p><p begin="2:18.560" end="2:25.500" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.560" end="2:18.940">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.940" end="2:19.240">き</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.240" end="2:19.820">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">超</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.820" end="2:20.180">こ</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.180" end="2:21.020">え</span><span begin="2:21.020" end="2:21.900">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.200" end="2:22.520">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.520" end="2:22.820">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.820" end="2:23.360">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">満</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.360" end="2:23.640">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.640" end="2:24.600">ち</span><span begin="2:24.600" end="2:25.500">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">待跨越时空 春暖花开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toki o koete hana ga michite</span></p><p begin="2:25.760" end="2:32.220" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.760" end="2:26.060">あ</span><span begin="2:26.060" end="2:26.380">な</span><span begin="2:26.380" end="2:26.960">た</span><span begin="2:26.960" end="2:27.300">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.300" end="2:27.880">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.880" end="2:28.180">と</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.180" end="2:28.800">へ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.800" end="2:29.073">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.073" end="2:29.600">ざ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.600" end="2:30.020">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.020" end="2:30.543">う</span><span begin="2:30.543" end="2:30.820">で</span><span begin="2:30.820" end="2:31.190">し</span><span begin="2:31.190" end="2:31.650">ょ</span><span begin="2:31.650" end="2:32.220">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">定会将我引向你的身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no moto e izanau deshō</span></p><p begin="2:32.920" end="2:40.120" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">祈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.920" end="2:33.280">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.280" end="2:33.540">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.540" end="2:33.983">り</span><span begin="2:33.983" end="2:34.133">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">束</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.133" end="2:34.760">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:34.760" end="2:35.300">ば</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.300" end="2:36.220">ね</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.433" end="2:36.820">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.820" end="2:37.080">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.080" end="2:37.660">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">放</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.660" end="2:38.020">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.020" end="2:38.880">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.880" end="2:40.120">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将祈祷悉数凝集 抛向天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">inori o tabane sora ni hanate</span></p><p begin="2:40.660" end="2:48.560" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.660" end="2:41.000">こ</span><span begin="2:41.000" end="2:41.300">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.300" end="2:41.660">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:41.660" end="2:42.220">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:42.220" end="2:42.500">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="2:42.500" end="2:43.060">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">流</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.060" end="2:43.400">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.400" end="2:44.280">が</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.280" end="2:45.220">れ</span><span begin="2:45.220" end="2:48.560">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">任我的心声流淌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono kokoro o nagareru</span></p><p begin="3:03.060" end="3:15.240" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">永</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.060" end="3:03.880">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.880" end="3:04.540">が</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.540" end="3:04.880">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:04.880" end="3:05.760">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.760" end="3:06.400">き</span></span></span><span begin="3:06.400" end="3:06.740">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:06.740" end="3:07.040">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.040" end="3:09.060">た</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">風</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.900" end="3:10.240">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.240" end="3:11.120">ぜ</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.120" end="3:11.720">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">授</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.720" end="3:12.060">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:12.060" end="3:12.960">ず</span></span></span><span begin="3:12.960" end="3:13.840">け</span><span begin="3:13.840" end="3:15.240">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让这永恒之歌 随风而去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nagai toki no uta kaze ni sazukete</span></p><p begin="3:16.160" end="3:22.900" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.160" end="3:16.540">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.540" end="3:17.100">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">立</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:17.100" end="3:17.260">だ</span></span></span><span begin="3:17.260" end="3:17.420">つ</span><span begin="3:17.420" end="3:17.580">も</span><span begin="3:17.580" end="3:17.720">の</span><span begin="3:17.720" end="3:18.119">よ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">光</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.120" end="3:18.340">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.340" end="3:18.920">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.920" end="3:19.080">り</span></span></span><span begin="3:19.080" end="3:19.220">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.220" end="3:20.080">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.080" end="3:20.840">も</span></span></span><span begin="3:20.840" end="3:22.900">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">先行者啊 请点亮光芒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sakidatsu mono yo hikari o tomose</span></p><p begin="3:23.340" end="3:31.640" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.340" end="3:23.620">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.620" end="3:24.200">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:24.200" end="3:24.380">し</span><span begin="3:24.380" end="3:24.500">み</span><span begin="3:24.500" end="3:24.700">す</span><span begin="3:24.700" end="3:24.840">ら</span><span begin="3:24.840" end="3:25.140">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">救</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:25.300" end="3:25.440">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:25.440" end="3:25.980">く</span></span></span><span begin="3:25.980" end="3:26.153">い</span><span begin="3:26.153" end="3:26.313">よ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">届</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.313" end="3:27.260">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.260" end="3:28.100">ど</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.120" end="3:31.640">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为悲伤也送去救赎吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanashimi sura mo sukui yo todoke</span></p><p begin="3:32.000" end="3:35.300" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.000" end="3:32.340">こ</span><span begin="3:32.340" end="3:32.620">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">声</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.620" end="3:33.060">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.060" end="3:33.260">え</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.260" end="3:33.600">が</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:33.820" end="3:34.120">よ</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.120" end="3:34.400">ぶ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">方</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.400" end="3:34.700">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.700" end="3:34.980">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.980" end="3:35.300">へ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">向着这歌声呼唤的方向</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono koe ga yobu hō e</span></p><p begin="3:35.620" end="3:42.500" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.620" end="3:35.940">よ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.940" end="3:36.200">る</span></span></span><span begin="3:36.200" end="3:36.820">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">超</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.820" end="3:37.160">こ</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.160" end="3:38.020">え</span><span begin="3:38.020" end="3:38.880">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.200" end="3:39.520">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.520" end="3:39.800">な</span></span></span><span begin="3:39.800" end="3:40.380">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">満</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:40.380" end="3:40.660">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:40.660" end="3:41.600">ち</span><span begin="3:41.600" end="3:42.500">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">待长夜破晓 春暖花开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yoru o koete hana ga michite</span></p><p begin="3:42.780" end="3:49.560" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.780" end="3:43.100">あ</span><span begin="3:43.100" end="3:43.420">な</span><span begin="3:43.420" end="3:43.960">た</span><span begin="3:43.960" end="3:44.280">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.280" end="3:44.840">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:44.840" end="3:45.140">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:45.140" end="3:45.720">へ</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">還</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.040" end="3:46.530">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.530" end="3:46.960">え</span></span></span><span begin="3:46.960" end="3:47.520">る</span><span begin="3:47.520" end="3:47.860">で</span><span begin="3:47.860" end="3:48.530">しょ</span><span begin="3:48.530" end="3:49.560">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我定会回到你身边吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">anata no moto e kaeru deshō</span></p><p begin="3:49.913" end="3:57.060" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:49.913" end="3:50.260">う</span><span begin="3:50.260" end="3:50.520">ね</span><span begin="3:50.520" end="3:51.160">り</span><span begin="3:51.160" end="3:51.380">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">裂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.380" end="3:52.053">さ</span></span></span><span begin="3:52.053" end="3:52.300">い</span><span begin="3:52.300" end="3:53.260">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">闇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.540" end="3:53.860">や</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:53.860" end="3:54.140">み</span></span></span><span begin="3:54.140" end="3:54.700">を</span><span begin="3:54.700" end="3:55.020">ほ</span><span begin="3:55.020" end="3:55.520">ど</span><span begin="3:55.520" end="3:55.940">い</span><span begin="3:55.940" end="3:57.060">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">撕碎海浪 劈开黑暗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uneri o saite yami o hodoite</span></p><p begin="3:57.640" end="4:04.680" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.640" end="3:58.060">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.060" end="3:58.340">め</span></span></span><span begin="3:58.340" end="3:58.620">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">中</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:58.620" end="3:59.220">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:59.220" end="3:59.500">か</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.500" end="4:00.100">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">濁</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.100" end="4:00.400">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:00.400" end="4:01.300">ご</span></span></span><span begin="4:01.300" end="4:02.180">ら</span><span begin="4:02.180" end="4:04.680">ず</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">梦境之中依旧澄澈不染</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yume no naka wa nigorazu</span></p><p begin="4:05.700" end="4:12.260" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">碧</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.700" end="4:06.220">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.220" end="4:06.540">お</span></span></span><span begin="4:06.540" end="4:06.730">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">続</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:06.730" end="4:07.020">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.020" end="4:07.280">づ</span></span></span><span begin="4:07.280" end="4:07.600">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">道</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.600" end="4:07.800">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.800" end="4:09.400">ち</span></span></span><span begin="4:09.400" end="4:12.260">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">延续向那碧蓝连绵的道路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aoku tsuzuku michi o</span></p></div></body></tt>